  "details": "Having taken a lot of pictures in VRChat, there are times when I wish that I could just click on people, and press a freeze button which freezes their position locally on my side. \n\nI would wait until I freeze everyone in the perfect pose, then step back and take a screenshot.\n\nRight now taking a quality screenshot is difficult with everyone running around all the time, and I don't expect them to stop for all of us photographers out there :)\n\nNot sure how technically feasible this would be but if it was doable would be a really cool thing.",
